WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.602 --> 00:00:18.362
Stay: Hi. It is late, so nothing big is needed. What would feel kind to start with? just keep me company, or empty my head, or one small start?

2
00:00:19.736 --> 00:00:21.311
Simulated voice: I keep putting off replying to my landlord about the renewal.

3
00:00:21.411 --> 00:00:24.842
Stay: Hey. Pick one sentence to send. Draft “Thanks for the notice; I’ll review and reply by tomorrow.” Then send it. Ready?

4
00:00:24.942 --> 00:00:25.742
Simulated voice: Can you break this down into an ultra-micro step?

5
00:00:25.143 --> 00:00:26.087
Simulated voice: Wait, stop. Actually, can we just make it smaller?

6
00:00:26.187 --> 00:00:29.547
Stay: Sure. Type “Thanks, will reply.” and hit send.

7
00:00:33.536 --> 00:00:35.052
Simulated voice: Hola, ahora necesito empezar mi declaración de impuestos, pero no sé por dónde empezar.

8
00:00:35.152 --> 00:00:39.749
Stay: Hola. Busca el formulario 1040 en el sitio del IRS. ¿Quieres abrirlo?

9
00:00:39.849 --> 00:00:42.849
Typed: show my history

10
00:00:44.561 --> 00:00:47.561
Typed: open brain dump
